# Keep the build context small and the image honest. (v5.34.63)
#
# Without this, `COPY backend ./backend` copies the HOST's node_modules over the
# ones `npm ci` just installed inside the image — so the container would run
# against macOS-built native modules, and the whole point of testing in a pinned
# Linux image would be lost. It is also the difference between a context of a
# few MB and one of several hundred.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
*.zip
backend/coverage
frontend/.firebase
